  <title>Data export</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Administration</gui><gui>Data</gui><gui>Data
  export</gui></guiseq> saves contacts or products to an .xls spreadsheet.</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Click <gui>Export contacts</gui> or <gui>Export products</gui>.
    The list shows what will be saved.</p></item>
    <item><p>Click <gui>Export contacts</gui> or <gui>Export products</gui>
    under the list, and choose where to save the file.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p><gui>Main page</gui> goes back. A file exported here has the layout
  <link xref="data_import"/> expects, so it is the best starting point for a
  file to import.</p>

</page>
